            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ina axweés dír Mose, baraá xatsaá Moabuwo wa ale, dír iisaapoó Yordani amór Yeriko, iwa kaahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Nee múk Israeli axweesé' ki beer, qoomár bár yaaér Yordani aga waarahhé', tari daté' baraá yaamaá Kana'ani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuungá' yaamuloouusér yaamuudá' sleémeero guusaak, tlaa/eeín kudá' taa tleéhh awa murslaaqat hhitimaak, nee slaqsi'iidá' taa kwahhuút hhaamisaak, wa/aamer'ín tidár ilahhooa fee/aak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuuín hayoohaak kiwa hota', asma ngaa kuungií haniís tawa aalirhúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamu kiri qasisá' ar loohír tsawdo adoodá' múk guruú doó wák i dirii'i, tlahhoó muu yaariír yaamuuín kin urees, tlahhoó muu niiná yaamuuín ki niina. Umuúqo heewo tidá' aa sláy ar loohír tsawdoorí a tós an alá' ar adoodá' gur'ér tlahhi'ii'ín i dirii'iya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxés yaamuloouusér yaamuusíng aga geerií gusi'iika, daqaní dirhunge a adór ilaá taa áy nee tsiriingw, nee adór laqeelo baraá bihherhúng, inooín kuungá' nun slahh'eemisiyá' baraá yaamaá tay hotaá eera'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng adoodá' naa tsabiím daanduuine ngi kuungá' i tleéhh.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.56"
            ]
          }
